cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "AgentChaos: Chaos engineering for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  AgentChaos injects tool failures (timeouts, errors, partial and malformed
  results) into an AI agent's MCP tool calls through a fault-injecting proxy,
  and grades how the agent behaves from the call trace.
